  "bodyHash": "9787f0b3bdb7a710",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>《Double Doors》是一款极简模组，它允许相同的成对木门、陷阱门和栅栏门同时开启。你只需点击任意一扇（木质）门，或使用单个压力板/按钮即可实现。默认情况下，模组还会自动查找并开启其他相连的门类方块，最大搜索距离为 10 格。此功能可在配置文件中开关。村民也能开启成对的门！ <br><br>按住潜行键将禁用双开门功能，仅开启/关闭单个方块。<br><br></span><span><strong>如果你希望栅栏门和陷阱门也能“成对”开启，请务必在配置文件中启用相关选项！</strong><br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收录于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收录于 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true<br>是否启用递归开启功能。启用后，例如你可以用陷阱门建造一扇巨大的门，只要它们相连，就能同时开启。'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 配置项决定了该功能的最大搜索距离。<br><br><span><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：10，最小值：1，最大值：32<br>当启用 'enableRecursiveOpening' 时，递归函数搜索的最大方块数量。<br><br><span><strong>enableDoors</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true<br>启用后，模组支持成对木门。<br><br><span><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false<br>启用后，模组支持成对栅栏门。<br><br><span><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false<br>启用后，模组支持成对陷阱门。<br><br><span><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true<br>检查是否加载了其他具有双开门功能的模组。如果找到，会修改其配置文件中的一行代码以禁用双开门功能。修复因代码重复运行导致门无法开启的问题。<br><br></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>适用于所有双开门组合，同时也支持与其他方块的递归联动！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span><strong>系统会自动递归查找并开启任何相连的门类方块：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br><span><strong>默认情况下，递归功能会开启 10 格范围内的方块，但你可以通过 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 配置项进行修改：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong><span><br>点击任意一扇门，另一扇也会随之打开：</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>使用单个按钮即可开启铁门，或尝试其他组合配置。</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>支持上下堆叠的陷阱门与栅栏门，可通过点击或压力板/按钮控制。</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>村民也能开启成对的门！</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
